  ('onaga', 'hi-deep7', 'hi-statewide', 'salt', 'bag_limit', '''Ula''ula koa''e (onaga) — Minimum size 1 pound (sale). Bag limit 5 (total all Deep 7 species, applies to non-commercial fishing only). (HAR 13-95, HAR 13-94, HAR 13-74) ''Opakapaka: minimum size 1 pound (sale). ''Ula''ula (ehu), kalekale, lehi, ''ukikiki (gindai), and hapu''u: bag limit 5 (total all Deep 7 species), non-commercial only.', 'https://dlnr.hawaii.gov/dar/fishing/fishing-regulations/marine-fishes-and-vertebrates/', 'DLNR Division of Aquatic Resources — Marine Fishes and Other Vertebrates (HAR 13-95, 13-95.1, 13-94, 13-74)', null, '2026-09-02', 1,
