  (null, null, 'hi-statewide', 'salt', 'note', 'Regulated Fishing Areas (West Hawaii Regional Fishery Management Area, Miloli''i Community-Based Subsistence Fishing Area, Hilo Bay, Kailua Bay, and others) carry their own permitted/prohibited lists and can be stricter than the statewide table — see DLNR DAR regulated-areas pages. Sea turtles (honu) and Hawaiian monk seals: no open season; unlawful to molest, kill, capture, or possess. (HRS 195D-4)', 'https://dlnr.hawaii.gov/dar/fishing/fishing-regulations/marine-fishes-and-vertebrates/', 'DLNR Division of Aquatic Resources — Marine Fishes and Other Vertebrates (HAR 13-95, 13-95.1, 13-94, 13-74)', null, '2026-09-02', 1,
